Z||000004||TheFiero64||04-09-2000||09:47 AM||||In pip if it is not posting when you push ctrl + V then <P>1. click the history icon in pip and find the pic you just posted.<P>2. click on the name of the pic under it.<P>3. hilight the url in clipboard contents: with the mouse<P>4. press ctrl + c then go to the forum and try your ctrl + v thing it will work every time.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR>||||reg||10
